# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: Prologue | Scene: OpeningScene

translate fr strings:

    old "King Orwell has returned from his travels through the provinces of Rosanna."
    new "Le Roi Orwell est revenu de ses voyages à travers les provinces de Rosanna."

    old "He enters the great hall of Castle Reinmeer, the snow of an early winter drifting in behind him."
    new "Il entre dans la grande salle du château de Reinmeer, la neige d'un hiver précoce s'engouffrant derrière lui."

    old "Finally, home again."
    new "Enfin, à la maison."

    old "King Orwell pluts his travel bag down."
    new "Le roi Orwell dépose son sac de voyage."

    old "FATHER!"
    new "PÈRE!"

    old "Sarah leaps into her father's arms."
    new "Sarah s'élance dans les bras de son père."

    old "Ooh, Sarah, my back! Please daugher, I'm not as young as I was, and you've grown much too big to just be jumping on me."
    new "Oh, Sarah, mon dos ! Ma chère fille, je ne suis plus aussi jeune que je l'étais, et tu es devenue bien trop grande pour continuer à sauter sur moi."

    old "You were gone for almost five months! If you thought I wasn't going to hug you, you don't know me at all."
    new "Tu as disparu pendant presque cinq mois ! Si tu pensais que je n'allais pas te serrer dans mes bras, tu ne me connais absolument pas."

    old "You've grown older but I don't think you've grown up yet."
    new "Tu as grandi, mais je ne pense pas que tu aies mûri."

    old "So mean!"
    new "Si méchante..."

    old "Speaking of growing up, have you seen..."
    new "En parlant de grandir, as-tu vu..."

    old "DAD!"
    new "PAPA !"

    old "Thomas Rose, Sarah's younger brother, and heir to the throne, embraces his father."
    new "Thomas Rose, le jeune frère de Sarah et héritier du trône, embrasse son père."

    old "I've missed you so much dad!"
    new "Je t'ai tant manqué, mon père !"

    old "King Orwell grabs his son by the shoulders and holds him at a distance."
    new "Le roi Orwell saisit son fils par les épaules et le maintient à distance."

    old "I missed you too son, but remember: composure. It's not befitting for a future king to be running around like a wild child."
    new "Te extrañaba también, hijo, pero recuerda: la compostura. No es propio de un futuro rey correr por ahí como un niño salvaje."

    old "That goes for both of you."
    new "C'est le cas pour vous deux."

    old "King Orwell looks sternly at his daughter."
    new "El rey Orwell mira a su hija con severidad."

    old "Yes Father."
    new "Oui, père."

    old "Good. Now, where is the royal assistant? I need begin drafting letters immediately."
    new "Bien. Où est l'assistant royal ? Je dois commencer à rédiger des lettres immédiatement."

    old "I think I saw him in the library, Father. I'll walk with you."
    new "Je pense l'avoir vu à la bibliothèque, Père. Je vous accompagnerai."

    old "Fine, fine. Thomas, find a servant to carry this luggage to my room. And don't let me catch you doing it yourself again."
    new "Bon, bon. Thomas, trouve un serviteur pour porter ce bagage dans ma chambre. Et ne me surprends plus à le faire toi-même."

    old "Yes, Father."
    new "Oui, Père."
